; Import definitions for the Winsock functions smbftp and the bundled libdsm
; call. TCC ships no ws2_32.def in some versions, so build.cmd always links this
; one (it is harmless where TCC has its own: build.cmd does not use -lws2_32).
LIBRARY ws2_32.dll
EXPORTS
closesocket
connect
getsockopt
htonl
htons
ioctlsocket
ntohl
ntohs
recv
select
send
socket
WSACleanup
WSAGetLastError
WSAIoctl
WSAStartup
